for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hell_Sphere\" title=\"Hell Sphere\">Hell Sphere</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>FLAMING_SPHERE</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Flaming_Aura\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Flaming Aura (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flaming Aura\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Flaming Aura (Condition)\">Flaming Aura</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Creature is standing within 1.5 m (5 ft) of a flaming sphere and will take <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">2d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> at the end of its turn. On a successful save, it will still take half damage.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Hellish_Sphere\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellish_Sphere_(Condition)\" title=\"Hellish Sphere (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Hellish_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hellish_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Hellish_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Hellish_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Hellish_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Hellish_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellish Sphere\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Hellish_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hellish_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Hellish_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Hellish Sphere</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Creature is standing within 3 m (10 ft) of a flaming sphere and will take <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">6d6</span>⁠<span cl